# Check out every text file with LF on every OS (TRBL-2026-0007). Windows runners default to
# core.autocrlf=true, which would turn golden files, .rivet fixtures and policy JSON into CRLF
# and break byte-exact comparisons (tests/fixtures/highlight, conformance goldens).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixtures stay byte-exact.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.vsix binary
*.bin binary
*.pb binary
